+// SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright 2026 citron Emulator Project / Nextendo Network
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
+
+// Nextendo port for Eden. Logic taken from citron-nextendo (GPL-3.0).
